{"id":"werewolves","name":"Werewolves","type":"creature","aliases":["howlpacks","wolf-man","wolf-things"],"description":"Instinctive, seemingly human creatures that transform into bloodthirsty wolf-like beasts, found on Innistrad, Dominaria, Ulgrotha and Eldraine.","pages":11,"first_seen":"2011-10-04","last_seen":"2025-01-24","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Werewolf","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Werewolf","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Werewolf","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Werewolf\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"innistrad-e0","era":{"date":"2011-09-30","era":"isd","label":"Innistrad"},"summary":"On Innistrad hedonistic vampires stalk the shadows, and the full moon can transform a villager into a werewolf.","participants":["vampires","werewolves","innistrad"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/innistrad","order":1931,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad block","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":6,"quote":"hedonistic vampires stalk the shadows to quench their thirst, and the full moon can transform a simple villager into a savage werewolf","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Innistrad#:~:text=hedonistic%20vampires%20stalk%20the,into%20a%20savage%20werewolf","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Innistrad","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Innistrad","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Innistrad#:~:text=hedonistic%20vampires%20stalk%20the,into%20a%20savage%20werewolf","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Innistrad\", section \"Flavor and storyline\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-backstory-update-dark-ascension-2012-01-03-e1","era":null,"summary