16-03-16#:~:text=His%20guide%20turned%20to,cracking%20and%20clothes%20tearing.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unwelcome","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-03-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=His%20guide%20turned%20to,cracking%20and%20clothes%20tearing.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwelcome\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"unwelcome-2016-03-16-e2","era":null,"summary":"The werewolf kills its horse as Jace flees; howls answer from the woods.","participants":["jace-beleren","werewolves"],"location":"stensia","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unwelcome-2016-03-16","order":541,"story_date":"2016-03-16","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":22,"quote":"Behind him, the horse's scream was cut short with a wet crunch.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=Behind%20him%2C%20the%20horse%27s,with%20a%20wet%20crunch.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unwelcome","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-03-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=Behind%20him%2C%20the%20horse%27s,with%20a%20wet%20crunch.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwelcome\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"unwelcome-2016-03-16-e3","era":null,"summary":"A pack of werewolves chases Jace toward the manor.","participants":["jace-beleren","werewolves"],"location":"stensia","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unwelcome-2016-03-16","order":541,"story_date":"2016-03-16","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":24,"quote":"There were at least three of them bounding after him, hideous amalgamations of human and wolf.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=There%20were%20at%20least,of%20human%20and%20wolf.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unwelcome","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-03-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=There%20were%20at%20least,of%20human%20and%20wolf.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwelcome\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"unwelcome-2016-03-16-e4","era":null,"summary":"Jace conjures a solid illusory bear that tackles one werewolf.","participants":["jace-beleren","werewolves"],"location":"stensia","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unwelcome-2016-03-16","order":541,"story_date":"2016-03-16","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"A hulking bear made of shining blue light took form behind him","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=A%20hulking%20bear%20made,took%20form%20behind%20him","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unwelcome","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-03-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=A%20hulking%20bear%20made,took%20form%20behind%20him","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwelcome\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"unwelcome-2016-03-16-e5","era":null,"summary":"Jace takes control of his guide's mind briefly, making it attack the pack's alpha, so the wolves fight each other.","participants":["jace-beleren","werewolves"],"location":"stensia",