yard-temple-2016-04-06","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/drownyard-temple-2016-04-06#:~:text=With%20great%20effort%2C%20the,contents%20exposed%20to%20air.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Drownyard Temple\" by Mel Li. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Apr 2016."}},{"id":"drownyard-temple-2016-04-06-e2","era":null,"summary":"The author finds the specimen's interior filled with sinew and almost nothing human, with a large cluster growing on the liver.","participants":["werewolves"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"stories/drownyard-temple-2016-04-06","order":544,"story_date":"2016-04-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":23,"quote":"This one, though. This one was...new.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/drownyard-temple-2016-04-06#:~:text=This%20one%2C%20though.%20This%20one%20was...new.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Drownyard Temple","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Mel Li"],"date":"2016-04-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/drownyard-temple-2016-04-06","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/drownyard-temple-2016-04-06#:~:text=This%20one%2C%20though.%20This%20one%20was...new.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Drownyard Temple\" by Mel Li. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Apr 2016."}},{"id":"innistrads-last-hope-2016-06-29-e3","era":null,"summary":"Liliana wants Jace to owe her, then hears a scream and finds werewolves overrunning her throne room.","participants":["liliana-vess","werewolves"],"location":"vess-manor","importance":"major","page":"stories/innistrads-last-hope-2016-06-29","order":559,"story_date":"2016-06-29","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":48,"quote":"Werewolves. Liliana's entire throne room was overrun.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/innistrads-last-hope-2016-06-29#:~:text=Werewolves.%20Liliana%27s%20entire%20t